<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Talbots said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Talbots said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber cut its rating on Talbots Inc to neutral from attractive, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- Talbots shares closed up 1-3/8 to 30-3/4 Thursday.</p>
</text>
